          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld/%2$lld chapters"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.c1.intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sechs Saiten, sechs Töne. Stimme sie eine nach der anderen, bis jede grün leuchtet."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Six strings, six notes. Tune them one by one until each one glows green."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.c1.success.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein warmer, klarer Klang füllt den Dachboden. Zum ersten Mal seit Jahren klingt sie wieder so, wie sie soll."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A warm, clear sound fills the attic. For the first time in years she sounds the way she should."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.c1.success.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Okay, Oma. Ich höre zu."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Okay, grandma. I am listening."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.d1.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regen trommelt aufs Dach. Zwischen Kisten und Staub findest du einen Gitarrenkoffer. Darauf: ein Brief mit deinem Namen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rain drums on the roof. Between boxes and dust you find a guitar case. On top of it: a letter with your name."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.d1.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wenn du das liest, gehört sie jetzt dir. Sie hat mir Türen geöffnet, die ich nie für möglich hielt. Finde die verlorene Melodie, dann verstehst du."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you are reading this, she is yours now. She opened doors for me I never thought possible. Find the lost melody, and you will understand."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.d1.3": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die verlorene Melodie? Oma, was soll das heißen?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The lost melody? Grandma, what is that supposed to mean?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.d2.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Du schlägst eine Saite an. Sie klingt schief, müde, verstimmt. So kann sie keine Tür öffnen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You pluck a string. It sounds crooked, tired, out of tune. Like this she cannot open any door."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.d3.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unten im Brief steht noch eine Zeile: „Frag Ferro in der Hafenstraße. Er kennt sie.“"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the bottom of the letter there is one more line: \"Ask Ferro on Harbour Street. He knows her.\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Brief und eine Gitarre"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A letter and a guitar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch1.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Dachboden"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Attic"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.c1.intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von unten nach oben: E, A, D, G, H, E. Nimm dir Zeit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From the bottom up: E, A, D, G, B, E. Take your time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.c1.success": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nicht schlecht. Die Saiten kennst du jetzt. Mila am Kai zeigt dir, wie aus Tönen Akkorde werden."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not bad. Now you know the strings. Mila at the pier will show you how notes become chords."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.ch1.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was ist die verlorene Melodie?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What is the lost melody?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.ch1.a.response": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ein Lied, das Rosa nur ein einziges Mal gespielt hat, beim Hafenfest. Danach nie wieder. Warum, hat sie nie gesagt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A song Rosa played only once, at the harbour festival. Never again after that. She never said why."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.ch1.b": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wie merke ich mir die Saiten?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How do I remember the strings?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.ch1.b.response": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Von dick nach dünn: E A D G H E. „Eine Alte Dame Ging Heringe Essen.“ Lach nicht, das vergisst du nie."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Thick to thin: E A D G B E. \"Eddie Ate Dynamite, Good Bye Eddie.\" Don't laugh, you will never forget it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.ch1.prompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Was willst du zuerst wissen?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "What do you want to know first?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.d1.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Werkstatt riecht nach Holz und Lack. Ein alter Mann mit Lupe im Auge schaut nicht einmal auf."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The workshop smells of wood and varnish. An old man with a loupe in his eye does not even look up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.d1.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rosas Gitarre. Ich habe sie vor vierzig Jahren gebaut. Du willst also die Melodie finden. Dann lern erst mal ihre Sprache."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rosa's guitar. I built her forty years ago. So you want to find the melody. Then learn her language first."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.d2.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jede Leersaite hat einen Namen. Spiel sie mir vor, von der dicksten zur dünnsten. Ich höre, ob du sie kennst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Every open string has a name. Play them for me, from the thickest to the thinnest. I can hear whether you know them."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sechs Saiten, sechs Namen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Six strings, six names"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch2.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ferros Werkstatt"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ferro's Workshop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.c1.intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erst Em, dann Am. Halte jeden Akkord, bis ich nicke."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "First Em, then Am. Hold each chord until I nod."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.c1.success": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hörst du das? Das ist der Hafen bei Nacht. Rosa hat genau so angefangen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hear that? That is the harbour at night. Rosa started exactly like this."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.d1.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Am Kai spielt eine Frau mit rotem Schal für ein paar Möwen und einen schlafenden Hund."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "At the pier a woman with a red scarf plays for a few seagulls and a sleeping dog."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.d1.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rosas Enkelkind! Sie hat mir mein erstes Lied beigebracht. Zwei Akkorde: E-Moll und A-Moll. Traurig und schön wie das Meer."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rosa's grandchild! She taught me my first song. Two chords: E minor and A minor. Sad and beautiful, like the sea."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.d2.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E-Moll: zwei Finger, zweiter Bund, auf der A- und der D-Saite. Alle sechs Saiten anschlagen. Los."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "E minor: two fingers, second fret, on the A and D strings. Strum all six. Go."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.d3.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Morgen zeige ich dir, wie die Wellen wechseln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tomorrow I will show you how the waves change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die zwei schönsten Akkorde"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The two most beautiful chords"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch3.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mila am Kai"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mila at the Pier"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch4.c1.intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Minute Wellen. Die App zählt jeden sauberen Wechsel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One minute of waves. The app counts every clean change."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch4.c1.success": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zehn! Kapitän Bo sucht einen Rhythmusgitarristen. Sag ihm, ich schicke dich."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ten! Captain Bo is looking for a rhythm guitarist. Tell him I sent you."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch4.d1.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Akkorde kennen ist das eine. Zwischen ihnen wechseln, ohne hinzusehen, das andere. Schau auf die Wellen. Sie zögern nie."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Knowing chords is one thing. Changing between them without looking is another. Watch the waves. They never hesitate."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch4.d1.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Eine Minute. Em, Am, Em, Am. Schaff mindestens zehn Wechsel, dann bist du bereit für die Band."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "One minute. Em, Am, Em, Am. Make at least ten changes and you are ready for the band."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch4.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wechseln ohne Nachdenken"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Changing without thinking"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch4.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der Rhythmus der Wellen"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Rhythm of the Waves"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.c1.intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G, C, D und zurück zu G. Sauber, jeden einzeln."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "G, C, D and back to G. Clean, one at a time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.c1.success": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das ist ein Rhythmusgitarrist. Morgen Abend, Hafenfest. Sei da."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Now that is a rhythm guitarist. Tomorrow night, harbour festival. Be there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.ch1.a": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bereit."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.ch1.a.response": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das gefällt mir."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That is what I like to hear."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.ch1.b": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Einen Tipp, bitte."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "A tip, please."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.ch1.b.response": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Beim Wechsel von G nach C bleibt der Ringfinger fast an Ort und Stelle. Und D ist ein kleines Dreieck. Denk an ein Segel."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From G to C the ring finger barely moves. And D is a small triangle. Think of a sail."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.ch1.prompt": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bereit, oder brauchst du einen Tipp?"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ready, or do you want a tip?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.d1.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In einer Lagerhalle probt eine Band aus Fischern und einer Trompeterin. Ein Bär von einem Mann winkt dich herein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In a warehouse a band of fishermen and a trumpet player is rehearsing. A bear of a man waves you in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.d1.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mila sagt, du kannst wechseln. Beim Fest spielen wir Oh! Susanna. Dafür brauchst du G, C und D. Die drei tragen die halbe Musikgeschichte."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mila says you can change. At the festival we play Oh! Susanna. For that you need G, C and D. Those three carry half of music history."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drei Akkorde für ein Fest"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three chords for a festival"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch5.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die Hafenband"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Harbour Band"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.c1.intro": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Spiel mit. Das Metronom führt, die App hört zu. Sechzig Prozent der Takte müssen sitzen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Play along. The metronome leads, the app listens. Sixty percent of the bars have to land."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.c1.success": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Der letzte Akkord verklingt über dem Hafen. Für einen Moment ist alles still. Dann Applaus."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last chord fades over the harbour. For a moment everything is quiet. Then applause."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.d1.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lampions über dem Wasser, hundert Leute, und die Band schaut zu dir. Ferro steht ganz hinten. Mila lächelt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Lanterns over the water, a hundred people, and the band is looking at you. Ferro stands at the very back. Mila smiles."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.d1.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oh! Susanna, in G. Wir folgen dir. Egal was passiert: nicht aufhören."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Oh! Susanna, in G. We follow you. Whatever happens: do not stop."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.d2.1": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rosa hat damals dasselbe Lied gespielt. Die verlorene Melodie war nie ein bestimmtes Lied. Es war der Moment, in dem sie aufgehört hat, Angst zu haben."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rosa played the same song back then. The lost melody was never a particular tune. It was the moment she stopped being afraid."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.d2.2": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Siehst du? Die Tür war die ganze Zeit offen. Weiterspielen. Kapitel sieben schreibst du selbst."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You see? The door was open the whole time. Keep playing. Chapter seven is yours to write."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.subtitle": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Die verlorene Melodie"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The lost melody"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "story.ch6.title": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Das Fest"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The Festival"
          }
        }
      }
    },
